  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You are comfortable fighting in very close quarters.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Tunnel Rat<sup>ARG</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You count as two sizes smaller than normal for the purpose of squeezing or being able to move through a creature’s space. You can use your swarming racial trait to share the square of any Small or smaller ally, even if that ally is not a ratfolk. You gain the benefit of your swarming racial trait; your ally does not gain this benefit but does not take any penalties from sharing your space.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-general-t-z-feats#toc18\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
